      CI-V address (IC-7300MK2 default 0xB6, IC-7300 0x94)\nlead_ms: delay after confirmed TX before audio
      is un-muted\ntail_ms: carrier hold after PTT release\ntx_timeout_s: watchdog, unkeys after this
      long in TX\ncw_wpm: keyer speed set on start and when changed (0 = leave radio setting)\nusb_mod_level:
      radio USB MOD Level %, set on start and when changed (-1 = leave)\nerror_hold_s: how long an error
      stays visible in the status text\nlib_dir: directory holding icom_civ.py (blank = flowgraph directory)\n'',
